# makepkg writes `src/` and `pkg/` next to the PKGBUILD, downloads sources into the package
# directory (`cities15000.zip`, `*.pkg.tar.zst`) and keeps a bare clone in a directory named after
# the package. Listing those artifacts one by one rots, so ignore the whole tree and re-include the
# files that are maintained below; a new file type has to be added here on purpose.
*

# Repository metadata.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/REUSE.toml
!/LICENSES/
!/LICENSES/**

# One directory per package, directly below the root. Only package metadata is tracked; `src/`,
# `pkg/` and the clone stay ignored with everything else. Local sources and patches (a PKGBUILD
# `source=()` entry that is not a URL) have to be re-included here by name.
!/*/
!/*/PKGBUILD
!/*/LICENSE
!/*/LICENSES/
!/*/LICENSES/**
!/*/REUSE.toml

# atrust's local sources: the tray launcher, the two systemd drop-ins for aTrustDaemon and the
# fixed copy of the client's bsod_checker.js that prepare() installs.
!/atrust/atrust-launcher.sh
!/atrust/atrust-daemon-curl.conf
!/atrust/atrust-daemon-shutdown.conf
!/atrust/bsod_checker.js

# zju-connect-git's systemd unit and ez4connect-git's desktop entry are local sources too.
!/zju-connect-git/zju-connect.service
!/ez4connect-git/EZ4Connect.desktop

# gotrust-git's desktop entry and icons are local sources too.
!/gotrust-git/goTrust.desktop
!/gotrust-git/goTrust.png
!/gotrust-git/goTrust-32.png

# monitor-control-git's input switcher wrapper is a local source too.
!/monitor-control-git/monitor-input

# monitor-control-git's udev rule and install scriptlet are local sources too.
!/monitor-control-git/60-monitor-control-i2c.rules
!/monitor-control-git/monitor-control-git.install
